OL,3,AClashes erupt in Paris and other cities
OL,4,Aafter thousands join mostly peaceful
OL,5,Aprotests across France
OL,6,
OL,7,FProtesters have clashed with police in
OL,8,Fsome French cities - including Paris -
OL,9,Fas tens of thousands of people take to
OL,10,Fthe streets
OL,12,FPolice fired tear gas in cities
OL,13,Fincluding Lyon and Marseille, while in
OL,14,FBordeaux, people were seen ripping
OL,15,Fboards from a shop and forming
OL,16,Fbarricades
OL,18,FBut - as our correspondent in Paris
OL,19,Freports - there has not yet been a
OL,20,Frepeat of the chaos seen during
OL,21,Fprevious demonstrations
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
