OL,3,AClashes erupt in Paris and other cities
OL,4,Aafter thousands join mostly peaceful
OL,5,Aprotests across France
OL,6,
OL,7,FFrance's interior minister earlier said
OL,8,F135 people were arrested across the
OL,9,Fcountry, while police in Paris seized
OL,10,Fweapons and gas masks
OL,12,FToday's marches follow last weekend's
OL,13,Friots and looting that saw more than
OL,14,F2,700 arrested
OL,16,FIn response, curfews, closures and
OL,17,Fprotest bans were put in place -
OL,18,Falthough some demonstrations were
OL,19,Fpermitted. Reminder: Why are people
OL,20,Fprotesting?
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
